摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin exposing MuApi's 100+ image/video/audio generation models as an agent tool","id":"gh:1336747263","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-muapi","slug":"SamurAIGPT/dsh-plugin-muapi","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","muapi"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin exposing MuApi's 100+ image/video/audio generation models as an agent tool"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-muapi"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that gives the agent a `muapi_generate` tool for MuApi — a unified API for"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" 100+ image, video, audio, and 3D generation models (Flux, Veo 3, Kling, Seedance, Suno, and more) b"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ehind a single `x-api-key`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Then, in Settings → muapi, set your API key credential (create one at muapi.ai/access-keys)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Registers one tool, `muapi_generate`:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- `model` — a MuApi model slug, e.g. `flux-schnell-image` or `kling-v2-1-image-to-video`. Browse the"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" full catalog at muapi.ai/playground; each model's exact parameters are documented at `https://muapi"},{"id":"p9s3","text":".ai/playground/{model}/llms.txt`.\n- `input` — that model's parameter object, e.g. `{ \"prompt\": \"a se"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"rene mountain lake at dawn\" }`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The tool submits the job (`POST https://api.muapi.ai/api/v1/{model}`), polls `GET https://api.muapi."},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ai/api/v1/predictions/{request_id}/result` until it completes or fails, and returns the output URLs."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Setting | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `tool.enabled` | `true` | Expose the tool to the agent. |\n| `tool.apiKeyEnv` | — | Credential refe"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rence for your MuApi API key. |\n| `tool.baseUrl` | `https://api.muapi.ai/api/v1` | API base URL. |\n|"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" `tool.pollIntervalMs` | `3000` | Delay between result polls. |\n| `tool.timeoutMs` | `600000` | Max "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"time to wait for a job to complete. |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
